    "title":  "Boethiah\u0027s Calling",
    "description":  "A Daedric quest requiring the Dragonborn to find the Sacellum of Boethiah, sacrifice a trusted follower on the Pillar of Sacrifice, slay the remaining cultists, then kill Boethiah\u0027s current champion at Knifepoint Ridge to claim the Ebony Mail and become her new champion.",
